.TH smi-zfs-org-create "1" "May 2026" "SMI Toolset" "SMI Infra Command"
.SH NAME
smi-zfs-org-create \- Create a ZFS dataset for an organisation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-zfs-org-create
.I COUNTRY_CODE ORG_SHORT_NAME
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-zfs-org-create
creates the ZFS dataset \fBtank/organizations/<cc>/<org>\fR if it does not already exist.
The \fB-p\fR flag is passed to \fBzfs create\fR so intermediate datasets are created automatically.
.PP
If the dataset already exists, the command prints a notice and exits successfully.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.B smi-zfs-org-create ee has
.PP
creates \fBtank/organizations/ee/has\fR, mounted at \fB/mnt/gintra/organizations/ee/has\fR.
.SH AUTHOR
.PP
